WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.744
Elly Korving is my coach, and here in the

00:00:03.744 --> 00:00:07.763
center of New York, near Times Square, I can

00:00:07.763 --> 00:00:11.781
say that she's very dedicated, qualified and

00:00:11.781 --> 00:00:14.977
determined to help me set my goals.

00:00:14.977 --> 00:00:20.000
For Europeans it's sometimes difficult to say out loud:

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.266
I want to make a good income.

00:00:22.266 --> 00:00:24.375
I want to have a free life.

00:00:24.375 --> 00:00:27.734
But Elly Korving is helping me with setting

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:30.703
these goals and achieving these goals.

00:00:30.703 --> 00:00:32.578
She's very good at that.

00:00:32.578 --> 00:00:35.938
And she has a big heart, and she also helps

00:00:35.938 --> 00:00:40.000
me discover the power of the universe with knowledge

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.107
from the East. So Elly Korving is, I would

00:00:44.107 --> 00:00:47.041
say, the master of my freedom.

00:00:47.041 --> 00:00:51.539
She's really a big help and a very good coach.

00:00:51.539 --> 00:00:55.940
This is Jan from New York City, in the United

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.700
States of America.
